      "displayText": "... Gre.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "002E002E002E0020004700720065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai l’impression qu’après toutes ces épreuves,\nun vrai lien s’est tissé entre vous deux...<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nTu devrais prendre ce Grenousse dans ton équipe.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 5108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 148
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grenou.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 5404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006E006F0075002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grenousse vous a rejoint !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 5420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004700720065006E006F007500730073006500200076006F0075007300200061002000720065006A006F0069006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Merci de m’avoir offert un tel spectacle !\nTiens, tu mérites une récompense !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 5476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu es aussi agile qu’un Grenousse, personne\nne t’arrive à la cheville !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJ’ai hâte de vous voir faire la course tous\nles deux sur les autres parcours !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 57,
      "offsetInSection": 5640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 158
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous devez faire de la place dans vos Boîtes pour\naccueillir Grenousse.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 58,
      "offsetInSection": 5956,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F0075007300200064006500760065007A0020006600610069007200650020006400650020006C006100200070006C006100630065002000640061006E007300200076006F007300200042006F00EE00740065007300200070006F00750072000A006100630063007500650069006C006C006900720020004700720065006E006F0075007300730065002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿;",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 59,
      "offsetInSection": 6100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Essaie de battre le record sur les autres parcours !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 60,
      "offsetInSection": 6112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00450073007300610069006500200064006500200062006100740074007200650020006C00650020007200650063006F0072006400200073007500720020006C00650073002000610075007400720065007300200070006100720063006F0075007200730020002100100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 57
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿=",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 61,
      "offsetInSection": 6228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF003D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu as appuyé sur <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0004>Sp_1.\nÇa veut dire que tu abandonnes ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 62,
      "offsetInSection": 6240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200061007300200061007000700075007900E90020007300750072002000100002BD0A000400530070005F0031002E000A00C70061002000760065007500740020006400690072006500200071007500650020007400750020006100620061006E0064006F006E006E006500730020003F00100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce qu’il y a ? Tu veux abandonner ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 63,
      "offsetInSection": 6368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D0063006500200071007520190069006C00200079002000610020003F002000540075002000760065007500780020006100620061006E0064006F006E006E006500720020003F00100002011401890000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’abandonne !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 64,
      "offsetInSection": 6464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019006100620061006E0064006F006E006E0065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Pas encore !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 65,
      "offsetInSection": 6492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00500061007300200065006E0063006F00720065002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est bien, ça, persévère !\nC’est comme ça qu’on progresse !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƉ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 66,
